---
source: site/tests/snapshots.rs
---
<div style="--yi-gap:var(--yi-space-lg)" class="yi-stack">
<div style="max-inline-size: 26rem" class="demo-card">
<div style="--yi-gap:var(--yi-space-sm)" class="yi-stack">
<b class="demo-title">Lockout policy</b>
<span>Accounts lock for 15 minutes after 5 failed sign-ins.</span>
<p class="yi-note yi-note--neutral">
<span class="yi-note__text">Passkey sign-ins never count towards a lockout.</span>
</p>
</div>
</div>
<div style="--yi-gap:var(--yi-space-xs)" class="yi-stack">
<p class="yi-note yi-note--ok">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="yi-icon yi-note__icon">
<path d="M2 12a10 10 0 1 0 20 0a10 10 0 1 0 -20 0M16 9l-5.5 5.5L8 12">
</path>
</svg>
<span class="yi-note__text">Saved. The service picks the change up on its next poll.</span>
</p>
<p class="yi-note yi-note--warn">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="yi-icon yi-note__icon">
<path d="M21.73 18l-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3M12 9v4M12 17h.01">
</path>
</svg>
<span class="yi-note__text">This certificate expires in 6 days.</span>
</p>
<p class="yi-note yi-note--danger">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="yi-icon yi-note__icon">
<path d="M2 12a10 10 0 1 0 20 0a10 10 0 1 0 -20 0M12 8L12 12M12 16L12.01 16">
</path>
</svg>
<span class="yi-note__text">The package could not be read.</span>
</p>
<p class="yi-note yi-note--info">
<span class="yi-note__text">Changes apply to new sessions only.</span>
</p>
<p class="yi-note yi-note--neutral">
<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="yi-icon yi-note__icon">
<path d="M5 11h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v7a2 2 0 0 1 -2 2h-14a2 2 0 0 1 -2 -2v-7a2 2 0 0 1 2 -2zM7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4">
</path>
</svg>
<span class="yi-note__text">Only administrators can change this setting.</span>
</p>
</div>
</div>
